  "Private texts can be public records?",
  "In 2013, an Illinois court made a major FOIA ruling.",
  "A reporter watched Champaign council members texting during a meeting.",
  "The reporter requested access to those private messages.",
  "City officials completely denied the disclosure request.",
  "The court ruled that personal devices must still reveal public business.",
  "This was the very first ruling of its kind in Illinois."
